"如果那不是您，而这条消息又让您觉得烦，请\n"
"把这封邮件转发给 %s，我们会为您\n"
"处理。"

#: www/forgotten-password.php:111
#, php-format
msgid "Your login id is: %s"
msgstr "您的登录 ID 是：%s"

#: www/forgotten-password.php:112
msgid "Your password recovery URL is:"
msgstr "您的密码重置 URL 是："

#: www/forgotten-password.php:115
#, php-format
msgid "the request came from %s"
msgstr "请求来自 %s"

#: www/forgotten-password.php:129
msgid "password"
msgstr "密码"

#: www/forgotten-password.php:151
msgid "Forgotten password"
msgstr "忘记密码"

#: www/forgotten-password.php:169
msgid "We have a problem!"
msgstr "出了问题！"

#: www/forgotten-password.php:196
msgid "User ID not found!"
msgstr "未找到用户 ID！"

#: www/forgotten-password.php:207
msgid ""
"The User ID you supplied could not be found.  Perhaps try your email instead?"
msgstr "找不到您提供的用户 ID。要不要改用邮箱试试？"

#: www/forgotten-password.php:209
msgid ""
"The email you supplied could not be found.  Perhaps try your User ID instead?"
msgstr "找不到您提供的邮箱。要不要改用用户 ID 试试？"

#: www/forgotten-password.php:234
msgid "Mail sent to your address"
msgstr "邮件已发送至您的地址"

#: www/forgotten-password.php:246
#, php-format
msgid ""
"A password recovery URL has been sent to the address we have on file.  If "
"you still can't get logged in please contact <a href=\"%s\">the webmaster</"
"a> and we'll see what we can do."
msgstr ""
"密码重置 URL 已发送到我们存档的地址。如果您仍然无法登录，请联系<a "
"href=\"%s\">网站管理员</a>，我们看看能做些什么。"

#: www/forgotten-password.php:252
msgid ""
"If you've forgotten your password, don't worry.  We've got that covered."
msgstr "如果您忘了密码，别担心，我们有办法。"

#: www/forgotten-password.php:254
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Please enter either your login or your email address (whichever you "
"remember), then click on '%s'."
msgstr "请输入您的登录名或邮箱地址（哪个还记得就填哪个），然后点击“%s”。"

#: www/forgotten-password.php:254 www/forgotten-password.php:264
msgid "eMail Me!"
msgstr "发邮件给我！"

#: www/forgotten-password.php:256
msgid ""
"We will send you an email with a link in it. Click on that link and you'll "
"be able to set a new password. This link will expire within a few hours. "
"This isn't exactly totally secure, but then we're only dealing with your "
"FreshPorts login, not a financial transaction...."
msgstr ""
"我们会给您发封邮件，里面有个链接。点击那个链接，您就能设置新密码。这个链接会"
"在几小时内失效。这算不上多么安全，不过我们处理的只是您的 FreshPorts 登录信"
"息，又不是什么金融交易……"

#: www/forgotten-password.php:262
msgid "email address:"
msgstr "邮箱地址："

#: www/login.php:104
#, php-format
msgid "Your account has been disabled.  Please contact %s"
msgstr "您的账户已停用。请联系 %s"

#: www/login.php:107
msgid ""
"Your account needs to be enabled by following the directions in the email we "
"have sent to you."
msgstr "您的账户需要启用，请按我们发给您的邮件中的说明操作。"

#: www/login.php:108
msgid ""
"To have your activation details resent to the email address you supplied, "
"click on the resend button"
msgstr "如需将激活信息重新发送到您提供的邮箱地址，请点击重新发送按钮。"

#: www/login.php:111
msgid "Resend"
msgstr "重新发送"

#: www/login.php:114
msgid "I have no idea what your account status is."
msgstr "我不知道您的账户处于什么状态。"

#: www/login.php:139 www/welcome.php:34
msgid ""
"You should soon receive an email at the mail address you supplied. It will "
"contain instructions to enable your account."
msgstr ""
"您应该很快会收到一封邮件，发往您提供的邮箱地址，其中含有启用账户的说明。"

#: www/login.php:141
#, php-format
msgid "I'm sorry but I couldn't send your token.  Please contact %s."
msgstr "抱歉，我无法发送您的令牌。请联系 %s。"

