msgstr "新用户信息"

#: www/new-user.php:227
msgid "Please observe the following points:"
msgstr "请注意以下几点："

#: www/new-user.php:230
msgid ""
"You must supply a valid email address. Instructions to enable your account "
"will be emailed to you at that address."
msgstr "您必须提供有效的邮箱地址。启用账户的说明会通过邮件发送到该地址。"

#: www/new-user.php:232
#, php-format
msgid "If you have a spam filter, please allow all mail from %1$s and %2$s."
msgstr "如果您使用了垃圾邮件过滤器，请放行来自 %1$s 和 %2$s 的所有邮件。"

#: www/new-user.php:234
msgid ""
"Please disable any auto-responders for the above domains.  I get enough "
